' S-104 (Mete karari 2026-09-20): acik MAIN varsa MAIN programin TEK govdesidir; MAIN disinda yalniz
' bildirimler (TYPE, CLASS, SUB, FUNCTION, CONST, global DIM ...) bulunabilir. Bu program dort motorda ayni cikar.
DIM g AS I32 = 5
CONST K = 7
TYPE Pt
    X AS I32
END TYPE
SUB Hello()
    PRINT "hello"
END SUB
MAIN
    DIM p AS Pt
    p.X = 3
    PRINT g
    PRINT K
    PRINT p.X
    Hello()
END MAIN